<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ page.meta_title }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ page.meta_description }}">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.base_url }}{{ current_url }}">

<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="{{ site.name }}">
<meta property="og:locale" content="{{ site.locale }}">
<meta property="og:title" content="{{ page.meta_title }}">
<meta property="og:description" content="{{ page.meta_description }}">
<meta property="og:url" content="{{ site.base_url }}{{ current_url }}">
{#- 1200 x 630, que es lo que llena la tarjeta de WhatsApp. El logo, casi
    cuadrado, se recortaba. -#}
<meta property="og:image" content="{{ site.base_url }}{{ og_image }}">
<meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
<meta property="og:image:height" content="630">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#3166A7" id="theme-color">
<script>
  // Runs before the stylesheet so the page never paints the wrong theme.
  (function () {
    var t;
    try { t = localStorage.getItem("theme"); } catch (e) {}
    if (t !== "dark" && t !== "light") {
      t = matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme: dark)").matches ? "dark" : "light";
    }
    document.documentElement.dataset.theme = t;
    if (t === "dark") {
      var m = document.getElementById("theme-color");
      if (m) m.setAttribute("content", "#245285");
    }
  })();
</script>

<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="32x32">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/img/favicon-180x180.png">

{% for face in font_faces %}
<link rel="preload" href="{{ face.file }}" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
{% endfor %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/site.css">
</head>
<body>

<a class="skip-link" href="#contenido">Saltar al contenido</a>

<header class="site-header" id="site-header">
  <div class="shell site-header__inner">
    <a class="brand" href="/"{% if current_url == '/' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>
      <span class="brand__wing">{{ wing_svg }}</span>
      <span class="brand__name">Panamails</span>
    </a>

    {#- El botón del tema ya no vive aquí: se mudó al menú de abajo, para que
        la barra no tenga dos controles de lo mismo en la misma esquina. -#}
    <div class="header-actions">
      <button class="nav-toggle" id="nav-toggle" type="button"
            aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-nav">
      <span class="nav-toggle__bars" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>
      <span class="nav-toggle__label">Menú</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <nav class="site-nav" id="site-nav" aria-label="Navegación principal">
      <ul class="site-nav__list">
        {% for item in nav %}
        <li>
          <a class="site-nav__link{% if current_url == item.url %} is-active{% endif %}"
             href="{{ item.url }}"{% if current_url == item.url %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>
            {{ item.label }}
          </a>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      {#- Same size and shape; only the colour separates them, so "Ingresar"
          reads as the way back in and "Registrarse" as the way to start. They
          live inside the nav so the phone puts them in the menu, where the
          header has room for nothing but the brand. -#}
      {#- Everything ships drawn and the script decides: with no JavaScript the
          usual two are what shows, which serves everybody. The site is static
          and cannot know whether there is a session; the only thing it can read
          is the crumb the panel leaves on the parent domain. See nav.js. -#}
      <div class="site-nav__account" data-account>
        <a class="btn btn--account btn--account-in" data-account-in
           href="{{ panel.base_url }}/entrar">{{ panel.login_label }}</a>
        <a class="btn btn--account btn--account-up" data-account-up
           href="{{ panel.base_url }}/registro">{{ panel.register_label }}</a>
      </div>

      {#- El mismo control con dos caras: tres líneas antes de entrar, el
          nombre de la cuenta después. Va dentro del nav a propósito — en el
          teléfono cae dentro del menú que ya existe, al final, en vez de poner
          una segunda hamburguesa al lado de la primera. -#}
      <details class="usermenu" data-usermenu>
        <summary class="usermenu__button">
          <span class="usermenu__bars" data-usermenu-bars aria-hidden="true">
            <span></span><span></span><span></span></span>
          <span class="usermenu__me" data-usermenu-me hidden>
            {% include "partials/icon-user.svg.j2" %}<span>{{ panel.account_label }}</span></span>
          <span class="visually-hidden usermenu__label" data-usermenu-label>{{ panel.options_label }}</span>
          <span class="usermenu__caret" aria-hidden="true">
            {% include "partials/icon-caret.svg.j2" %}</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="usermenu__panel">
          {#- Una cuenta de administrador no tiene clientes a los que
              escribirle, así que el panel de envíos y los contactos le salen
              vacíos: en su lugar ve administración. Quién es lo dice la
              galleta que deja el panel, y nav.js decide con ella. -#}
          <a class="usermenu__item" data-admin-only hidden
             href="{{ panel.base_url }}/admin/">
            <span class="usermenu__icons">{% include "partials/icon-shield.svg.j2" %}</span>
            <span>{{ panel.admin_label }}</span></a>

          {#- El panel va primero porque es a lo que se dedica la empresa: lo
              demás son ajustes de la cuenta, y se buscan cuando hace falta. -#}
          <a class="usermenu__item" data-client-only hidden
             href="{{ panel.base_url }}/panel">
            <span class="usermenu__icons">{% include "partials/icon-chart.svg.j2" %}</span>
            <span>{{ panel.panel_label }}</span></a>

          <a class="usermenu__item" data-client-only hidden
             href="{{ panel.base_url }}/contactos">
            <span class="usermenu__icons">{% include "partials/icon-people.svg.j2" %}</span>
            <span>{{ panel.contacts_label }}</span></a>

          <a class="usermenu__item" data-account-only hidden
             href="{{ panel.base_url }}/configuracion">
            <span class="usermenu__icons">{% include "partials/icon-gear.svg.j2" %}</span>
            <span>{{ panel.settings_label }}</span></a>

          <button class="usermenu__item" id="theme-toggle" type="button"
                  data-mode-dark="{{ panel.theme_dark }}"
                  data-mode-light="{{ panel.theme_light }}">
            <span class="usermenu__icons">
              <span class="theme-toggle__sun">{% include "partials/icon-sun.svg.j2" %}</span>
              <span class="theme-toggle__moon">{% include "partials/icon-moon.svg.j2" %}</span>
            </span>
            <span data-theme-label>{{ panel.theme_dark }}</span></button>

          {#- El español es lo que hay. El inglés se anuncia y nada más: una
              opción que todavía no hace nada lo dice en vez de fingir. Un
              <details> dentro del que ya es el menú, así que abre y cierra sin
              JavaScript igual que el de fuera. -#}
          <details class="usermenu__sub usermenu__group">
            <summary class="usermenu__item">
              <span class="usermenu__icons">{% include "partials/icon-globe.svg.j2" %}</span>
              <span>{{ panel.language_label }}</span>
              <span class="usermenu__value">{{ panel.language_current }}</span>
              <span class="usermenu__caret" aria-hidden="true">
                {% include "partials/icon-caret.svg.j2" %}</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="usermenu__subpanel">
              <p class="usermenu__item is-on">
                <span class="usermenu__icons">{% include "partials/icon-check.svg.j2" %}</span>
                <span>{{ panel.language_current }}</span></p>
              <p class="usermenu__item is-off">
                <span class="usermenu__icons"></span>
                <span>{{ panel.language_soon }}</span></p>
            </div>
          </details>

          {#- Un enlace, no un formulario: este sitio está en otro dominio y no
              lleva ningún testigo del panel. La página a la que llega es la que
              pregunta y la que cierra. -#}
          <a class="usermenu__item usermenu__item--out" data-account-only hidden
             href="{{ panel.base_url }}/salir">
            <span class="usermenu__icons">{% include "partials/icon-exit.svg.j2" %}</span>
            <span>{{ panel.logout_label }}</span></a>
        </div>
      </details>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<span class="visually-hidden" role="status" id="theme-status"></span>

<main id="contenido">
{% block main %}{% endblock %}
</main>

<footer class="site-footer" id="contacto">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="site-footer__top">
      <div class="site-footer__brand">
        <a class="brand brand--footer" href="/">
          <span class="brand__wing">{{ wing_svg }}</span>
          <span class="brand__name">Panamails</span>
        </a>
        <p class="site-footer__desc">{{ footer.description }}</p>
      </div>

      <nav class="site-footer__cols" aria-label="Navegación del pie">
        {% for col in footer.columns %}
        <div class="site-footer__col">
          <h2 class="site-footer__title">{{ col.title }}</h2>
          <ul>
            {% for link in col.links %}
            <li>
              {% if link.url %}
              <a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.label }}</a>
              {% else %}
              <span class="site-footer__soon">{{ link.label }}
                <span class="tag">{{ footer.soon_label }}</span>
              </span>
              {% endif %}
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}

        <div class="site-footer__col site-footer__col--contact">
          <h2 class="site-footer__title">Contacto</h2>
          <ul class="contact-list">
            <li>
              <a href="{{ whatsapp_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                {% if social_icons.whatsapp %}
                <span class="icon icon--mask" style="--icon: url('{{ social_icons.whatsapp }}')" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                {% else %}
                {% include "partials/icon-chat.svg.j2" %}
                {% endif %}
                <span>{{ contact.whatsapp_display }}</span>
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <button class="copy-inline" type="button" data-copy="{{ contact.email }}"
                      aria-label="{{ contact.email_copy_label }} {{ contact.email }}">
                {% include "partials/icon-mail.svg.j2" %}
                <span class="copy-inline__text">{{ contact.email }}</span>
                <span class="copy-inline__done" aria-hidden="true">{{ contact.email_copied_label }}</span>
              </button>
              <span class="visually-hidden" role="status" data-copy-status></span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="{{ contact.instagram_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                {% if social_icons.instagram %}
                <span class="icon icon--mask" style="--icon: url('{{ social_icons.instagram }}')" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                {% endif %}
                <span>@{{ contact.instagram_user }}</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="site-footer__legal">
      <p><span>&copy; <span id="year">2026</span> {{ footer.legal_note }}</span></p>
      {% if payment_logos %}
      <p class="payments">
        <span class="payments__label">{{ footer.payments_label }}</span>
        {% for logo in payment_logos %}
        <img class="payments__logo" src="{{ logo.url }}" alt="{{ logo.name|capitalize }}"
             width="28" height="28" loading="lazy">
        {% endfor %}
      </p>
      {% else %}
      <p class="payments"><span class="payments__label">{{ footer.payments_fallback }}</span></p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script src="/assets/js/nav.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
